    {
      "id": "6777bbd3d5f07d3b6c478eb893d5481559e844dc5cf26c9504421b8bd730fa34",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a8690f29f1fbab13e1401e4ff4238b293f33b0c241bec2acfe11db795d42121",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e914ed9fddfbf65de67872912330cd2a13a190438b5edf10cc8dd1260911e9e",
      "text": "Creating Embeddings",
      "hash": "da86d4ec35a382e2e637aaeb61dff56aab3b740f8ac80953689ac7826c486993"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f0331bb3cf6eabd3290423cdab9fe5b51728c4bbe143c4aa49166812cbcd7cf",
      "text": "Creating a Vector Database",
      "hash": "b2b2075f509001f86a6e6e6dd4e1687f791ba07d5b5972365546edeefa00da19"
    },
    {
      "id": "b72fc169e44b120e0c8bbf6d2cedfa2119a305e9ca0bbd13a72eb4aa5aef2ac3",
      "text": "Searching for Similar Embeddings",
      "hash": "61e4f94dec6a34d0d4fdf5579771d9ab4ba07312ce4f4f6b9d639f03ca0e8739"
    },
    {
      "id": "5afc435f039101d62c9f8d10cf11995df7d8d2a23de3fe4fd663917583bade9f",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5976b6f749c942201860bda8c213f05532e62b2811ae4006a5ac77e4974b1174",
      "text": "Vercel's AI SDK has a really simple way to create embeddings.",
      "hash": "12b78ae28cb9ed6b745c7078c5c2b1e954b8d79c20c5aff3a01926dde1525946"
    },
    {
      "id": "732af27ec20ca89903e18d2c808a4d4d4975de9ee275e179d1ad1cd998c91598",
      "text": "Embeddings are a way to represent words, images, or data in a high-dimensional space.",
      "hash": "76cf9771e5dc07505bdf2f49a65a437ac615c0314f90721e8339f6e739f6f6c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1d4e3de4c39741dbccad3c6f46bb26ce74fb13801023fbaa8084a6c7693d72",
      "text": "This is extremely useful when you want to see how similar two things are to each other.",
      "hash": "b62a0f699ceb68680af0db828d6c121d1d6a3725c58c9abc7edcca5d61ca362d"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1f8f4944893697b99e4a5dc836ac702ce3f415a816c454a19aedf0eabc03b66",
      "text": "This makes embeddings a really powerful primitive for tasks like searching or categorization.",
      "hash": "eadd520408df1fb571c93a6062a4e99fea3500160580223fe303ecc15ccacbf2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9d2ed2506442c62e7ff3251313504e435f30c677081c6f15e18abf986e08021",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "4cc91265932dba717a678d12b21b2024cab32d9b2dcce18b529e5bef7177aa08",
      "text": "The first step is to grab the embedding model, the one we're using is from OpenAI.",
      "hash": "d4eef559038613f8a61208dfb45ef94b9d495030d12ad1ac04110e998b33cc64"
    },
    {
      "id": "b29f6e1ef7f16837f6234fc9b1f03d473ebdcecc48dd2d111dd07ecd4b7d7f87",
      "text": "We're just going to embed some words: dog, cat, car, and bike. So we're going to put those in an array.",
      "hash": "93e089b4529af2fe0b7c5ad251e0709d2649f408636c1b9c3ba405e8d0592751"
    },
    {
      "id": "07421552e91570697b776652bdaf47b8f9102e70720270544e7699afd0aa0339",
      "text": "Then we're going to use the",
      "hash": "fe96e3e8766337de6370b22497501d7f7934226c1d4fd2f0cbbe79f133fb4af7"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bc8bd21a6e8f67e2fb3a2ae951a883a7acfa25f53e32eed2f1c2ca0d8090e1a",
      "text": "function from the AI SDK, passing in our model and the values.",
      "hash": "e636bb25c70ee9ac3dfd6656d1a026f3f9cd80068a37894bf359bf51b9c44c4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "e76aa9b2f132c3e7298a3ca0165ab8f81376fd8ffcb7c9b1ee7e60d1d5ec92e0",
      "text": "Let's log this out to see what we've created here.",
      "hash": "994e81f7329e5a7fd55b7178b783b4995883f4cccf6efa33630514034a67a09f"
    },
    {
      "id": "167c622cd1253ccb3108465e64d8e04a27148d49d681ef42887bb57982883565",
      "text": "As we can see, it's a bunch of arrays containing a load of numbers. These are vectors and these vectors represent a location in multi-dimensional space.",
      "hash": "9e7fe3e33eff2e38f58f0cd6813b00944e2228585d6f321457bb4c33e51b183d"
    },
    {
      "id": "09b1c276197ea5f074acb42bddd630aea11388dbf9a8676e82a3dc9d8c9c238f",
      "text": "Depending on the model, these arrays might be thousands of numbers long. And these numbers, i.e., the vector, represent the LLM's understanding of what that word is.",
      "hash": "0e36f5a0989f6ed8f556d28fffa9a05e4ad24d17a23fb1da24e3dba01f601857"
    },
    {
      "id": "b40f8dcdde10ef3ee2661d0bf308a6730dcd40df5dbb6ccf9395a25f862543d5",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "93ba3b673f9d43cf68f05b9630e4efa5125ac1812053ed8f281011a54d9f82fa",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "098445bc7ee08cb65fbed6ff37be481d1a1e7d09fd938f73cab5679e965a0798",
      "text": "We can now collect those vectors together with the values they represent in a vector database.",
      "hash": "26d27ecb9b5684149408a0fab8b8091c6b95d15fd5ff09179b7fff11c422d87c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5fde6e910bf373bd45e4fa873cbdf6c27f49d3233f424bb4077839a5065975d",
      "text": "This is an extremely simple version of a vector database. It's just a list of vectors with the values they represent attached.",
      "hash": "618fe9c5ba0022eb6685bd40755fcc7e8ef9453ab9d36aec751580054580a27f"
    },
    {
      "id": "140b429ad926b0ab268684b1049b243d848cd28e6bd18718be0a07eb2c4e2a5f",
      "text": "In the real world, you might want to use Postgres and use an extension like",
      "hash": "0ba4eea544e90293ff4b520602772a1e3ceb7dad297767e7463fa38fb490122e"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d01f21de80c18bdc4d84b2f198ca5cbd05633dc4025542bcb2c0f615d4ff167",
      "text": "to add the ability to query vectors.",
      "hash": "486d57b1f8689590320f22d5ddf58d7e830b2cc8690c2b1b76cc50afe1c46ab0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb2144bf75f47fe0bc388df4f2a56fde79bf109f4914cdd27fc373338a4f016d",
      "text": "Let's now use this vector database. We're going to search for an entry in our database which is most similar to a search term.",
      "hash": "20c3fdfda2e5c02843783ed9adf8eb695c1e28c3fea3b256b6385da265cfc610"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f909b582e870a6044b4e6ca25a2fd7e5fbfd0129e87d11c7cc1cca91181f6bc",
      "text": "We're going to have to embed one more word, our search term.",
      "hash": "622e89de8b4b9a34ebccd83c66fcd167dce5b9f1cfccde4cb485307cf47eb158"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c1d905afa870e842a0891659f0cd6b113e803bb71de74853fc59f23d668931",
      "text": "For that, we can use the",
      "hash": "0aef6a0422233009935f79dc69be80083f34ac2b78f096b598cb067761a4d159"
    },
    {
      "id": "57adc6e09dc980d64a782a72ea0ab7393a547b72e4db7b4235ca071591b279e4",
      "text": "function from the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "bec4439bbcf0fd20fc462814595529fd6dd33662ca1b90eb317ac8895e8e35d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "17f9f63e99343a9e50836a73ca6399b2fdb4941931a5ae3005875f6e2c3f7ea5",
      "text": "Let's search for the word that's most similar to \"Canine\".",
      "hash": "5fd5e2d5d94883d8eeda73ceba019efb9b3926426125fb87cdea026cbda4744e"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e30fb33d6beea534f602d9e168608622986647b6aaec8ac225cf203316f6649",
      "text": "Now we've got all of the vectors we need. That's literally all the information we require to perform a similarity search. We don't need to query the LLM again.",
      "hash": "42f2b065237cf7caa5b35df4c5d9876da9c3b347c04c34694adc52cfa495ae5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "1dc98bb29c5456f203279b7454e6905c4189fb3474a204c5146f83b16afe94fe",
      "text": "We now need to calculate the cosine similarity between the search term and each of the vectors in the database.",
      "hash": "80d928d86f4de791ca75c93402913c85f2b780fc4a51ead7613e97e918665781"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f53204163dbcd88e17fe3ba9f4c884850f1a64726d19b01e374dfd635e02aa1",
      "text": "Fortunately, the AI SDK exposes a",
      "hash": "5e8d89da669aa4783793ebacc5576eab67634de66d7b565505d001aaacf858d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa657c2a6995b8b3585b1ddc0659229296e43afb9cb2cb8c0d226c46ba2ededa",
      "text": "function.",
      "hash": "78655d4d73de012287e630a648d3bc75193043eb45bfd031f8cd041012119e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "b215f68ed3d5ac6bf385a669d9af758450ba605aeb214f50f5e4d0568fd8227e",
      "text": "We're going to map over each entry in the database, calculating the similarity of each entry to the search term.",
      "hash": "f80071dda1da6988da8a477ef39817a9da103dcf4d013bd5fa17123ee6d6c6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "01ae4890bfbc742d23384839037072e23699a9ef1d916f28960717e2d71cddf5",
      "text": "Then we're going to sort them by similarity.",
      "hash": "ce012e6b7c94fd147b589ae360b433998130bb873092b5bc58ba62e89067cf91"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c2a2c7fdf444f3cb3424a05a0a14cd722e1e6c1572fd89b2329cb2dfe79822e",
      "text": "If we log this out, we notice that the similarity is a number between zero and one, calculated to many decimal places.",
      "hash": "730b0f5d58869c15bc77f2709a4adf1fc0d5d2637c36c2e394cc0038c7e783b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "453fe7beecd835ce90901811bf42f103e5550f0f8521581e775a7038f12e218e",
      "text": "And we'll notice that",
      "hash": "7518e4e2dc3a4efca69aa9f0d6af74e6a0754b2b7bdea0a4b0bd68f8579db121"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e8cf2f08433d7c62f911515ef2fd864a6a6dc5dce12fd78df189a684377f7c9",
      "text": "is at the top - that's because it's the most similar to",
      "hash": "090a1ae506d7a93a4bf502cbd6ebb02c6d95cf742c1a2e1af023dd3579b950c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "f67b2377e112996fa6d6d12fe35f54613897927e30cabda78cf96a127061ecf2",
      "text": "This relatively simple setup can drive all sorts of awesome features like search and categorization.",
      "hash": "45aab5e88b656eda1bf0199b0213de8c61d353d8b283211b1ac8282c7567904b"
    },
    {
      "id": "a913d5efbaf1621c6add16b3536acd75d1ed615c250240cc18b02135cbf1d2c5",
      "text": "And it's really nice that the AI SDK exposes the",
      "hash": "427680487bd2f4c658a89927b3ccad004a12763fc21a02cfb702f2e2ff21a050"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d767c0004c949fc1a24078a7e0dbee76cecbba5f3c1d025acc1f8d7f13537e5",
      "text": ", and",
      "hash": "4aa9bfd2f175a94ad5a7cb321e1aea9790c73eb366a3415b47a00aeaa9fbf24a"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e5418bdcdcafbd7f430dadaf4b94961202716e168a648b76377ce6ba027e16e",
      "text": "functions - as well as the ability to query embedding models.",
      "hash": "390c8930f5dd81eb9d0213904c953b0ef9bce2e980d75de8cc68ea104be16680"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e35d96d063d412ce0d7b406c6e774b1645c27cca78c7c6510361dbee823278a",
      "text": "Share on X",
